    {
      "id": "c2",
      "kind": "concept",
      "body": "Since the two orders gave 17 and 25, composition is **not commutative**. When you build a composite's **rule**, substitute the whole inner formula: f(g(x)) = 2(x²) − 1 = 2x² − 1, while g(f(x)) = (2x − 1)².",
      "figure": "fna-not-commutative"
    },
    {
      "id": "k2",
